  "title": "TX14",
  "description": "TX14 is an EEG dataset collected while participants performed a local situational awareness task and simultaneously maintained supervisory control of a semi-autonomous vehicle. It addresses the shift of the soldier's role from active controller to system monitor and manager in autonomous military systems. The dataset supports study of trade-offs between local area awareness (target/threat detection) and vehicle control, informing dynamic task allocation in crewstations.",
